## Model card

- **Name:** GPT Realtime 2.1
- **Short description:** OpenAI's speech-to-speech realtime voice-agent model with configurable reasoning effort, instruction following, and tool use.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Realtime API `v1/realtime`, model ID `gpt-realtime-2.1` (Realtime endpoint only; Chat Completions and Responses not supported).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-07-06 release (models.dev); knowledge cutoff 2026-09-30 (OpenAI docs; models.dev lists 2024-09-30)
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-realtime-2.1`
- **Context window:** 128,000 total with 32,000 max output (OpenAI docs; models.dev lists 96K input cap)
- **Modalities:** Text, audio, image in; text and audio out; reasoning yes (configurable effort: minimal/low/medium/high/xhigh); tool calls yes (function_calling); prompt caching yes
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-29):** Text $4.00/$24.00 per 1M in/out (cached $0.40); audio $32.00/$64.00 per 1M in/out; image $5.00 per 1M in (OpenAI docs)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (no params, license, or weights disclosed)

